Description: fix event loop, V-Sync and shutdown
 * process every pending SDL event each frame instead of reading one
   (possibly uninitialized) event per frame: keys and window events
   were lost or handled late, and garbage could trigger a quit.
 * enable V-Sync after the GL context creation.
 * remove the duplicate viewport computation in main(), whose local
   variables shadowed the globals and were unused.
 * close audio and call SDL_Quit on exit.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-16
